You are welcome. I can use larger machine by chance, and also tested
there just now.

Test environment
================

 - kernel:         2.6.21-rc6-CFS
 - run time:       300 secs
 - # of CPU:       12
 - # of processes: 200 or 2400

Result
===================================

  +----------+-----------+-------+------+------+--------+
  |   # of   |   # of    | avg   | max  | min  |  stdev |
  |   CPUs   | processes |       |      |      |        |
  +----------+-----------+-------+------+------+--------+
  |          |       200 |  2250 | 2348 | 2204 |     64 |
  | 12(ia64) +-----------+-------+------+------+--------+
  |          |      2400 | 187.5 |  197 |  176 |    4.3 |
  +----------+-----------+-------+------+------+--------+

Looks like good too.


